Mapbox earcut.hpp is vendored in XIOS as extern/remap/src/earcut.hpp, compiled
into libxios.a and installed as include/earcut.hpp. The vendored copy carries
no licence header and upstream's LICENSE file was not copied in with it, so
this is the licence text from https://github.com/mapbox/earcut.hpp.


